      </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
    </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
    <bpmn:process id="W_W3747" name="W3747. Measurement &amp; Verification (M&amp;V) and Energy Performance Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: ECM completion (W3753); reporting cycle
Frequency: Per ECM + continuous
Volume: M&amp;V per ECM; ongoing performance tracking
Owner: EEO / Sustainability
Participants: EEO, Sustainability (links to VS-25), Facilities (links to VS-20.3), BI (links to VS-28.1), Finance (links to VS-17.4), PMO (links to VS-112), Store Ops (links to VS-07)
Source: workflow W3747 — Measurement &amp; Verification (M&amp;V) and Energy Performance Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3747_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3747_Lane1" name="EEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3747_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3747_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3747_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3747_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3747_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3747_Start3" name="ECM completion (W3753); reporting cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3747_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3747_Task4" name="EEO/Sustainability establish M&amp;V protocols per ECM (IPMVP-aligned): baseline…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/Sustainability establish M&amp;V protocols per ECM (IPMVP-aligned): baseline, the measurement plan, adjustment for variables (weather, occupancy, sales volume), and the verification period to confirm realized savings vs business case
Responsible (R): EEO / Sustainability / BI
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Per ECM</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3747_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3747_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3747_Task5" name="EEO/BI track energy performance continuously: monitor EnPIs (kWh/sqm…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EEO/BI track energy performance continuously: monitor EnPIs (kWh/sqm, kWh/revenue, cost) against baseline and target (W3740), detect performance drift, and identify under-performing sites/ECMs for action
Responsible (R): EEO / BI / Facilities
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3747_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3747_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3747_Task6" name="EEO/Finance/Sustainability verify and report savings: confirm realized…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: EEO/Finance/Sustainability verify and report savings: confirm realized kWh/PHP/GHG savings, report to benefits realization (links to VS-112.3), FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), ESG/GHG accounting (links to VS-25/W192/W3466), and program analytics (links to W3756)
Responsible (R): EEO / Finance / Sustainability
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3747_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3747_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3747_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3747_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3747_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-138 (ensure RA 11285 energy compliance &amp; M&amp;V integrity.) | - operational: M&amp;V protocol; operational: continuous tracking
Owner: EEO / Sustainability</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3747_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3747_Annotation8" targetRef="W3747_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
