    <bpmn:process id="W_W3748" name="W3748. Energy Conservation Plan Development &amp; DOE Submission" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: RA 11285 conservation-plan obligation; audit (W3745); annual cycle
Frequency: Annual + on audit
Volume: Per designated entity
Owner: EEO / Compliance
Participants: EEO, Compliance (links to VS-22), Sustainability (links to VS-25), Facilities (links to VS-20.3), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Legal (links to VS-100.3), Records (links to VS-88)
Source: workflow W3748 — Energy Conservation Plan Development &amp; DOE Submission</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3748_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3748_Lane1" name="EEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3748_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3748_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3748_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3748_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3748_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3748_Start3" name="RA 11285 conservation-plan obligation; audit (W3745); annual cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3748_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3748_Task4" name="EEO/Compliance/Sustainability develop the Energy Conservation Plan (ECP) per RA…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/Compliance/Sustainability develop the Energy Conservation Plan (ECP) per RA 11285: the energy-performance baseline, targets, the ECM program (W3746/W3749), the operational/behavioral measures (W3750/W3751), the monitoring/reporting approach, and the resources/timeline
Responsible (R): EEO / Sustainability / Facilities
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3748_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3748_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3748_Task5" name="EEO/Compliance submit the ECP to DOE per the IRR, manage DOE review/feedback…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EEO/Compliance submit the ECP to DOE per the IRR, manage DOE review/feedback, and maintain the plan current with audit findings (W3745) and business change; coordinate cross-entity (links to VS-72)
Responsible (R): EEO / Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
