    <bpmn:process id="W_W3752" name="W3752. Renewable, Self-Generation &amp; Grid-Interaction Integration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Renewable project (links to VS-108); grid event; tariff strategy
Frequency: On project + ongoing
Volume: Renewable/self-generation across the estate
Owner: EEO / Renewable Program
Participants: EEO, Renewable Program (links to VS-108), Facilities (links to VS-20.3), Procurement (links to VS-34), Treasury (links to VS-18), Sustainability (links to VS-25), Finance (links to VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W3752 — Renewable, Self-Generation &amp; Grid-Interaction Integration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3752_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3752_Lane1" name="EEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3752_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3752_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3752_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3752_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3752_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3752_Start3" name="Renewable project (links to VS-108); grid event; tariff strategy">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3752_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3752_Task4" name="EEO/Renewable integrate demand-side efficiency with own-generation: coordinate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: EEO/Renewable integrate demand-side efficiency with own-generation: coordinate the ECM program (reduce demand first) with rooftop-solar/storage deployment (links to VS-108), so generation is sized to optimized demand; sequence efficiency before generation
Responsible (R): EEO / Renewable / Facilities
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: On project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3752_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3752_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3752_Task5" name="EEO/Renewable/Treasury manage grid interaction and net-metering (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: EEO/Renewable/Treasury manage grid interaction and net-metering (links to VS-108.2): self-consumption vs export, peak-shaving, demand-response participation, and the economic optimization of generation vs grid supply (links to W3742)
Responsible (R): EEO / Renewable / Treasury
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3752_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3752_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3752_Task6" name="EEO/Sustainability attribute renewable generation and efficiency savings to GHG…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: EEO/Sustainability attribute renewable generation and efficiency savings to GHG reduction (links to VS-108.3/W3466/W192), and report the combined demand-side + supply-side decarbonization to ESG (links to VS-25) and program analytics (links to W3756)
Responsible (R): EEO / Renewable / Sustainability
Accountable (A): EEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3752_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3752_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3752_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3752_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3752_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-590 (ensure controlled execution — Energy Audit, Measurement &amp; Conservation Plan Management (PA-120.2).) | - operational: efficiency-first sequencing; operational: grid-interaction optimization
Owner: EEO / Renewable Program</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
